"relshipp2024.json\",\"license\":\"US government variable metadata\",\"sha256\":\"8f0e7392b196399e54e81855affb53f614f7539f0b4b5ccf32fbc4fd8ddfdf33\",\"url\":\"https://api.census.gov/data/2024/acs/acs1/pums/variables/RELSHIPP.json\"}],\"split\":\"Deterministic SHA256 ordering salts german-plane-2026, german-within-2026, acs-within-2026. German content groups 50:50 planes, then 60:20:20; ACS excludes ALL CA/NY raw predictor overlaps before selection of 33334 content groups/state and 60:20:20. One representative/group, duplicate and conflicting-label provenance retained.\"}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
