0.9934934139002477 std [0.86888, 0.95669, 0.97869] two [0.29047, 0.94206, 0.9779] CI [0.9924407907738467, 0.9945685087300261]\nacs_logistic candidate 0.99999999999282 std [0.95843, 0.98337, 1.0] two [0.93974, 0.98091, 0.99281] CI [0.9999999999912866, 0.9999999999941666]\nacs_forest candidate 0.9999999999999994 std [0.96657, 0.98774, 1.0] two [0.94561, 0.98621, 0.99402] CI [0.9999999999999994, 0.9999999999999998]\nseed 155921\ngerman_logistic candidate 0.9964494244710433 std [0.93884, 0.97611, 0.98939] two [0.2977, 0.97124, 0.9871] CI [0.9959843487120774, 0.9968429356993416]\ngerman_forest candidate 0.9938632356331012 std [0.88945, 0.95329, 0.98126] two [0.31777, 0.947, 0.97903] CI [0.9928739317383152, 0.9947199150751206]\nacs_logistic candidate 0.99999999999282 std [0.95438, 0.98375, 1.0] two [0.92883, 0.97973, 0.99387] CI [0.9999999999912866, 0.9999999999941666]\nacs_forest candidate 0.9999999999999994 std [0.96394, 0.98599, 1.0] two [0.93285, 0.98176, 0.99454] CI [0.9999999999999992, 0.9999999999999997]\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
